  odd  ranks (1,3,5,7): [1.279299169433289, 1.2980194215562006, 3.4022236533287447, 5.072944161481768]
  even>對應 odd 4/4: True
  even 子序列單調增: True [1.335773473637605, 3.7213645096037764, 5.226071971731118, 5.544207038269895]
  odd 子序列單調增: True [1.279299169433289, 1.2980194215562006, 3.4022236533287447, 5.072944161481768]
